2 Installation
**************

Dag Draw requires Emacs 26.1 or later and the ‘dash’ and ‘ht’ packages.

   Clone the repository and put it on your ‘load-path’:

     (add-to-list 'load-path "/path/to/dag-draw.el")
     (require 'dag-draw)

   or, with ‘use-package’:

     (use-package dag-draw
       :load-path "/path/to/dag-draw.el")


