5.9 Configuration Variables
===========================

All of these are customizable with ‘M-x customize-group RET dag-draw
RET’.

 -- User Option: dag-draw-default-output-format
     The format used by ‘dag-draw-render-graph’ when none is given.  One
     of ‘svg’, ‘ascii’, or ‘dot’.  Default ‘svg’.

 -- User Option: dag-draw-default-node-separation
     Minimum horizontal separation between nodes in the default
