 -- User Option: dag-draw-default-rank-separation
     Minimum vertical separation between ranks in the default coordinate
     space.  Default ‘25’.

 -- User Option: dag-draw-ascii-node-separation
     Horizontal spacing between nodes in ASCII mode, in characters.
     Default ‘6’.

 -- User Option: dag-draw-ascii-rank-separation
     Vertical spacing between ranks in ASCII mode, in rows.  Default
     ‘5’.

 -- User Option: dag-draw-ascii-coordinate-scale
     Scale factor converting GKNV coordinates to the ASCII grid.
     Default ‘0.15’.

 -- User Option: dag-draw-svg-coordinate-scale
     Scale factor applied to coordinates in SVG output.  Default ‘10.0’.

 -- User Option: dag-draw-render-svg-node-fill
     Default node fill color in SVG.  Default ‘"#f0f0f0"’.

 -- User Option: dag-draw-render-svg-node-stroke
