 -- User Option: dag-draw-render-svg-edge-stroke
     Default edge color in SVG.  Default ‘"#666666"’.

 -- User Option: dag-draw-debug-output
     When non-‘nil’, print diagnostic messages during layout and
     rendering.  Default ‘nil’.


